Title: 200 AMSTERDAM: THE VERTICAL CITY
Credit: Written for the Screen by
Author: Danny Bouldiez
Episode: PART 08: THE FALL & THE GHOST IN THE TANK (CHAPTER 07)

====

INT. 200 AMSTERDAM - ELEVATOR SHAFT 3 - NIGHT

Elevator Car 3 hangs suspended at Floor 42. Emergency red lights GLOW inside the glass cab.

TEN RESIDENTS huddle in terror.

SOUND: The high-speed cable WHINES, slipping against the traction sheave.

INT. STAIRWELL B - CONTINUOUS

Hundreds of panicked residents in evening gowns and suits descend in a claustrophobic stampede, guided only by phone flashlights.

Water is already trickling down the concrete stairs like a subterranean waterfall.

INT. ROOFTOP DAMPER VAULT - FLOOR 70 - CONTINUOUS

The 400-ton mass damper SWINGS violently off-axis. 

It SLAMS into the reinforced concrete retaining wall. *CRASH!*

Concrete shatters into dust. The entire top five floors shudder and list three degrees to the west.

FADE TO BLACK.
